@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List (page 1, 5 per page)
GET {{base}}/api/internships?page=1&limit=5

### Filter + sort
GET {{base}}/api/internships?status=open&mode=remote&sort=stipend&order=desc

### Search
GET {{base}}/api/internships?q=python

### Get one
GET {{base}}/api/internships/1

### Create
POST {{base}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud Support Intern",
  "company": "Acme Corp",
  "location": "Delhi",
  "mode": "remote",
  "stipend": 12000,
  "duration_weeks": 8,
  "skills": ["AWS", "Linux"],
  "deadline": "2027-03-01"
}

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/api/internships/13
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "closed" }

### Replace
PUT {{base}}/api/internships/13
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud Intern",
  "company": "Acme Corp",
  "location": "Delhi",
  "mode": "hybrid",
  "duration_weeks": 10,
  "deadline": "2027-03-15"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/internships/13

### Validation error (400)
POST {{base}}/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "mode": "space", "deadline": "2027-02-30" }

### Not found (404)
GET {{base}}/api/internships/999
